          K("Parliament levied the surcharge in May.", "LEVIED", "The surcharge was levied in May.", "Pasiva institucional."),
          G("The duty holds _____ as the firm operates in the jurisdiction.", "insofar", "Insofar as."),
          G("This clause applies _____ prejudice to clause 2.", "without", "Without prejudice to."),
          G("Fines were issued. _____ a result, two contracts were reopened.", "As", "As a result."),
